                    int CAT(foo,__LINE__);
                    int CAT(foo,__LINE__);

                as __LINE__ is copied into the  input  stream,  yielding
                "foo__LINE__"  in  both  cases, rather than the expected
                "foo123", "foo124", which would result if __LINE__  were
